e task wants me to rewrite the undated file so it aligns with the other three latest reports. \n\nQuestion: should the rewritten undated file simply be updated to match the dated 商业模式 file? Or should it be a fresh rewrite?\n\nThe task: \"重写 reports/600036招商银行-商业模式-段永平视角.md，使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐：同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点。\"\n\nKey requirement: \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致\" — the four perspectives' 建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅 should be CONSISTENT unless justified.\n\nCurrent state of \"latest\" files:\n- 巴菲特: 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0, +10.6%, 加权目标 42.3 元\n- 芒格: +10.7% (42.4 元 implied), 击球区 🟡附近偏绿\n- 李录: 建仓 37.0, 补仓 33.5, +2.9% — justified divergence (等更大折扣, 李录 style)\n- 段永平 dated: 建仓 40.8, 补仓 36.0, +14.1% — this DIVERGES from 巴菲特's 38.5/35.0 without clear justification.\n\nSo the dated 段永平 file has numbers that DON'T align: +14.1% vs 巴菲特 +10.6%, 建仓 40.8 vs 38.5. The 综合研判 averages the four targets to 42.0 (+9.6%).\n\nGiven the task instruction that the four perspectives should align on 建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅 unless justified, and that 段永平's business-model perspective would naturally align with 巴菲特/芒格 (good company, reasonable price — 段永平 isn't a deep-discount waiter like 李录), the rewritten 商业模式 file should use:\n\n- 内在涨幅: +10.6% (aligned with 巴菲特's weighted target 42.3 元; 芒格 +10.7%)\n- 建仓价: 38.5 元 (aligned with 巴菲特)\n- 补仓价: 35.0 元 (aligned with 巴菲特)\n- 击球区: 🟡附近偏绿 (aligned with 芒格, consistent with 巴菲特 \"现价已破线第一批可启动\")\n\nHmm, but wait. Should I align to 巴菲特's 38.5/35.0 or keep 段永平's 40.8/36.0? The task says \"使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐\" — align with the OTHER THREE latest reports. The other three are 巴菲特/芒格/李录. 李录 has a justified divergence (37.0/33.5, +2.9%). The majority aligned view is 巴菲特 38.5/35.0, +10.6% and 芒格 +10.7%.\n\nSo the business-model perspective, unless justified to differ, should adopt: 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0, 内在 +10.6% (or state the 42.3 元 weighted target), 击球区 🟡附近偏绿.\n\nIs there justification for 段永平 to differ? His perspective is \"好生意 + 合理偏低的价格，分批不重仓\". His old file had 建仓 41/补仓 36 at 40.36 元 (PB 0.85x/0.75x anchors). The dated file kept PB 0.85x → 40.8 and PB 0.75x → 36.0. But 巴菲特's anchors: 38.5 = PB 0.81x (2026E), 35.0 = PB 0.74x. Hmm, these PB anchors differ because 段永平 used different BVPS maybe (47.3? 40.8/0.85 = 48.0 元 BVPS — that's the old \"2026E BVPS 约 48 元\" from the old file!). The old file used 2026E BVPS 48 元 → 1.05x = 50.4, 0.92x = 44.2, 0.75x = 36.0. Weighted = 43.0.\n\nThe dated file says 加权内在价值 43.7 元. Hmm, that would come from 50.4×0.2 + 44.2×0.5 + 36.0×0.3 = 43.0, not 43.7. Or maybe they used different numbers. Anyway.\n\nThe current official alignment per team-lead: 四视角加权目标价约 42.0 元, 内在涨幅约 +9.6%.\n\nHmm wait, actually let me compute: 巴菲特 42.3, 李录 39.4, 芒格 ~42.4 (implied from +10.7%: 38.29×1.107 = 42.4), 段永平 43.7. Average = (42.3+39.4+42.4+43.7)/4 = 167.8/4 = 41.95 ≈ 42.0 ✓. So team-lead averaged including 段永平's 43.7.\n\nOK so the task now: rewrite the undated 商业模式 file. The question is what numbers to use. The task instruction is clear: align 建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅 with the other three, unless justified divergence.\n\nGiven:\n- 巴菲特: 建仓 38.5 / 补仓 35.0 / +10.6% / 现价已破线可启动\n- 芒格: +10.7% / 🟡附近偏绿\n- 李录: 37.0 / 33.5 / +2.9% (justified: 等更大折扣)\n\n段永平's business-model stance: 好生意（银行里唯一接近好生意的），好公司合理偏低价格 → 分批建仓，不重仓. He's between 巴菲特 (value) and 李录 (deep discount). His original anchors: PB 0.85x 建仓, 0.75x 补仓. But with the aligned BVPS 47.3 (2026E), PB 0.85x would be 40.2 元, PB 0.75x = 35.5 元.\n\nHmm. But the task says the four should be CONSISTENT. So the cleanest approach: 段永平 adopts the same 建仓价 38.5 / 补仓 35.0 as 巴菲特, 内在涨幅 +10.6% (weighted target 42.3 元), 击球区 🟡附近偏绿. And note in the report that his 商业模式视角 converges with the other views — his own business-quality assessment supports the same buy zone; he doesn't demand 李录's extra discount because the business is the best-in-class bank and the price is already at 0.81x PB historical bottom.\n\nActually wait — but hold on. Let me reconsider. Maybe the intent of the task: The dated 商业模式 file exists (20260819) but the UNDATED one is the \"canonical\" one referenced by filename (the task says \"同视角若存在带 -YYYYMMDD 日期后缀的新文件和旧文件，优先读带日期后缀的新文件\" — for step 1, the three perspectives. For 商业模式, the task says read the OLD undated file since it's outdated, then REWRITE the undated file.)\n\nHmm, but wait — if there's a dated 商业模式-20260819 file that's newer, why rewrite the undated one? Possibly because the user wants the undated canonical file updated to the latest state (the undated file is what gets referenced without date). The dated one exists from the previous rerun. \n\nActually, re-reading the task: \"2) 读旧文件 reports/600036招商银行-商业模式-段永平视角.md（商业模式 视角，内容已过时）3) 重写 reports/600036招商银行-商业模式-段永平视角.md，使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐\"\n\nSo the undated 商业模式 file is considered the outdated one and needs rewriting. The dated 商业模式 file (20260819) has already been \"aligned\" in a previous run... but its numbers (+14.1%, 40.8 建仓) actually DIVERGE from the other three (+10.6%, 38.5). The user's instruction now emphasizes: 同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点.\n\nThis suggests the user noticed the 段永平 numbers diverge (+14.1% / 40.8 vs +10.6% / 38.5) and wants the rewritten undated file to properly align. The task is on the UNDATED file specifically though. I should rewrite the undated file with aligned numbers.\n\nWhich aligned numbers? The dominant aligned set from the latest three reports:\n- 内在涨幅: +10.6% (巴菲特) ≈ +10.7% (芒格) → use **+10.6%** (weighted target 42.3 元)\n- 击球区: 🟡附近偏绿 (芒格; 巴菲特's stance \"现价已破建仓线，第一批可启动\" is effectively 🟡偏绿)\n- 建仓价: 38.5 元 (巴菲特; 李录 37.0 is a justified divergence downward)\n- 补仓价: 35.0 元 (巴菲特)\n\nFor 段永平: business-model perspective. Justification check: would 段永平 differ from 巴菲特's 38.5/35.0? 段永平's style: \"好公司 + 合理偏低价格，分批，不重仓\" — close to 巴菲特's. The old 段永平 anchors were PB 0.85x/0.75x which with updated BVPS 47.3 gives 40.2/35.5 — still slightly higher than 巴菲特. But the task says align unless justified. There's no strong justification for 段永平 to demand a HIGHER entry price than 巴菲特 — that doesn't even make sense as a divergence rationale (being pickier about business quality would justify LOWER prices like 李录, not higher). So 段永平 should adopt 38.5/35.0.\n\nSo the rewritten file:\n- 现价 38.29 元 (2026-08-18), 市值 9656.68 亿\n- 内在涨幅: **+10.6%** (三情景加权目标价 42.3 元 vs 现价 38.29 元 — aligned with 巴菲特/芒格)\n- 击球区: 🟡附近偏绿 (aligned)\n- 建仓价: **38.5 元** (PB 0.81x 2026E, 股息率 5.24%)\n- 补仓价: **35.0 元** (PB 0.74x, 股息率 5.76%)\n\nWait, but should 段永平's target price be exactly 42.3? His own three-scenario would use his PB anchors. To \"align\", the cleanest is to adopt the same three-scenario table as 巴菲特: 1.05x/0.92x/0.75x on BVPS 47.3 → 49.7/43.5/35.5, weights 20/50/30 → 42.34 ≈ 42.3, +10.6%. That's the aligned computation. The business-model report can present it through the 段永平 lens: PB-ROE anchored on business quality, \"好生意应得的 PB\".\n\nHmm, but 段永平's original weights were also 0.2/0.5/0.3, same as 巴菲特. And his old BVPS was 48 vs 巴菲特's 47.3 — minor difference. So aligning is straightforward: use BVPS 47.3, PB 1.05/0.92/0.75 → 49.7/43.5/35.5 → weighted 42.3 → +10.6%. \n\nNow, the file must end with \"## 量化结论\" section with EXACTLY five lines:\n- 内在涨幅: **X%**\n- 击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\n- 目标建仓价: **X 元**\n- 二次补仓价: **X 元**\n- 数据核验: ✓/⚠️ 说明\n\nThe task says \"严格包含五行（字段名与格式禁止改动）\". So exactly these five lines with these field names. Looking at 李录's quant section, it has 6 lines (extra 评级 line). The task wants strictly 5 lines. So I must not add a 评级 line.\n\nLet me draft:\n\n```\n## 量化结论\n\n- 内在涨幅: **+10.6%**（三情景加权目标价 42.3 元 vs 现价 38.29 元，与巴菲特/芒格视角一致）\n- 击球区: 🟡附近偏绿 —— 银行里最好的生意 + PB 0.81x 历史底区 + AUM 18 万亿护城河增厚，现价已破建仓线可分批启动；零售风险拐点未确认（8-29 中报裁决），分批不重仓\n- 目标建仓价: **38.5 元**（PB 0.81x[2026E]/股息率 5.24%，现价已破线，第一批可启动）\n- 二次补仓价: **35.0 元**（PB 0.74x/股息率 5.76%，贴近 2024 历史低点）\n- 数据核验: ✓（现价 38.29 元三源一致；市值 38.29×252.198 亿股=9656.68 亿偏差 0.00%；AUM 18 万亿双源一致；估值以手工列式复算替代 financial_rigor.py[Bash 不可用]）\n```\n\nField names: \"内在涨幅\", \"击球区\", \"目标建仓价\", \"二次补仓价\", \"数据核验\" — 